[REL] TILE_REV, BAR_REV and TBL_REV are equal for the current month, and TILE_CNT equals TBL_CNT {SPEC}
[REL] TILE_REV equals STAT_REV and TILE_CNT equals STAT_CNT - the rep's own orders only, so the seeded buyer-created and flag-cancelled orders contribute nothing {BL}
[REL] TILE_REV_RELOAD equals TILE_REV and URL_RELOAD equals URL_PAGE after the reload {SPEC}
[COUNT] "Reporting" items in the left rail == 1 {OBSERVED}

[REL] WEST_REV equals the AcmeWest current-month statistics from npm run sales-rep:stats (the seeded WEST_1 and WEST_2 orders; the flag-cancelled order contributes nothing) {BL}
[REL] TECH_REV equals the TechFlow current-month statistics from npm run sales-rep:stats {BL}
[REL] WEST_REV, TECH_REV and ALL_REV are pairwise different {SPEC}
